/* ---- Sprite size: change SPRITE_H in the three places marked below ---- */
/*
   SPRITE_H is set by `background-size: auto <SPRITE_H>px`, NOT by min-height.
   min-height is only a floor; the pill already allocates more height than that,
   so editing it does nothing. min-width does not set the height either -- it
   only has to be wide enough that the sprite isn't cut off horizontally:

       min-width >= SPRITE_H * aspect ratio        (round up)

